<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai security forces seized millions of meth pills after an armed clash with border troops, while authorities issued arrest warrants for high-profile suspects in cross-border money-laundering and stock-market scandals. The government proposed a 15‑day visa-free entry for travellers from three countries and is introducing digital border passes at the Mae Sai crossing, joining Singapore and Malaysia in the BLOOM cross-border digital money settlement initiative. Joint maritime patrols and a newly completed phase of a border fence in Chanthaburi aim to curb crime and improve connectivity with Malaysia. 35 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOTm9OLUsxOFNicVF4enA4bDh1UVJKcnNvc3VRbHpTalMyQnBaVjlxeEF4eDFTbm9NSTBmYWpyQUlTU0tGLU5vYlkyT0I2NGc3LVpMdzhRdU5EamtLRmhTU1JWR3JZMDl1UEkwbTl5Um5VOWJNQ3NRWFhrQk9nTi1rUDE3Sml4WGY1OFN2UTdmaHpMX1dOYjBJRFZpOFpOeFRvc2VYQ1h5OExZdV9NRTZRS3RsUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangkok Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khaosod English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTFBiUUQ5WE5OTTJuU0lSVEcwdVYzdHhCclZFWlVkcnpXaFVTZzBfSGpVNk9DTXNvOUtEemJNUkdjYXlzbmFyUmlPOWpGTEdxTURhMEhJeVhjSExzeGxkcUladQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;kaohoon international&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNNG81c1phVzZrSkJ3elR1NDRxallkb1FGaF9LSkRidE40OURZQk9SRFBPQUhhNENNMkx0LVNYelp2U1dzakhqUmFMazN3N2NFSEtaVGswVkRIZEU4b1R0cUE5SnZyVTNpZUduRFFmZVlnN0NveFU0dEFaRVRSMXI2V2dRcGVGTHlYSzgxZDFUQWl2Mk94VThpeHZqY0Q1d1RjYXRBY0pMMUZGZ1psQUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.co